# Remotion Video Elements Library

This project contains a library of reusable Remotion video elements for tutorial and marketing video production. All parametrized elements use Zod schemas editable from the Remotion Studio sidebar. Rendering supports transparent backgrounds (ProRes 4444).

## Rendering

- Default codec: ProRes 4444 with PNG image format for transparency
- CLI: `npx remotion render <CompositionId> out/video.mov`
- Pixel format: `yuva444p10le` (set in `remotion.config.ts`)
- All overlay elements use `backgroundColor: "transparent"` so they can be composited in external editors

## Assets

Static assets live in `public/`:
- `jfrog_logo.svg` — JFrog logo
- `docker_logo.svg` — Docker logo
- `npm_logo.svg` — npm logo

Reference them with `staticFile("filename.svg")`.

