### 8. StopwatchCounter

**File:** `src/StopwatchCounter.tsx`
**Composition ID:** `StopwatchCounter`
**Use case:** Real-time stopwatch that counts from 00:00 to a target time, then blinks red. Duration auto-adjusts via `calculateMetadata`. Three visual styles.

| Parameter          | Type                                          | Default     | Description                     |
|--------------------|-----------------------------------------------|-------------|---------------------------------|
| `targetMinutes`    | number (0–59)                                 | 2           | Target minutes                  |
| `targetSeconds`    | number (0–59)                                 | 30          | Target seconds                  |
| `style`            | `"digital"` / `"airport"` / `"analog"`        | `"digital"` | Visual style                    |
| `size`             | `"small"` / `"medium"` / `"large"`            | `"medium"`  | Overall scale                   |
| `showMilliseconds` | boolean                                       | true        | Show centiseconds (digital/airport only) |

**Note:** Composition duration auto-calculates based on target time + enter/blink/exit buffer.

